<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">2 Teselonk'e</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Teselonk'e</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Teselonk'e Ashwots Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Gitl Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">Teselonk'e Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Krstos aanar weyi jangosh aatets aato fayo tizfere b́ amtsotse Teselonk'e Ik' mootse fa'a gond bek'o ayefere bi'ami, P'awlos Teselonk'e ashuwotssh b́ guut'ts gitl wosho «Doonzo weyi aawo bodre» etts imnetiyo s'illike b́ teshi, P'awlos Krstos wooniyere shinon «Gond asha» eteets Krstosi k'efiru jishirwotsn datsanats gondonat ale k'azon ayefere ametuwe ett bo imnetiyo káátsosha b́tuu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosh na'o, nababirwotsats gond bek'ona et kic'on boats b́ ayiyalor dab bo imnetiyats bo kúp'itwok'o bonat k'osh binton finirwots bok'alirwok'o bobeyosh geyiyitwo daatsosh kúp'ar bo finitwok'o mank'o sheeng fino finoke boatso bo bazirawok'o kup'shdek't boon b́ izi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Udona et adaron 1:3-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos aani weyi jangosh imets dano 2:1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstani beyi jagosh izetso 3:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">B́ ko'ewoko 3:16-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Wosh. 17:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o no nihinat no doonz Iyesus Krstosok wotts Teselonk'e Ik' meyitsi amantsuwotssh P'awulosoke, Silasnat Timotiyosoke guut'dek't wosheets wosho.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Ik'o nihoke no doonz Iyesus Krstosoke s'aatonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos aanar gitlo b́woor bí ímet angsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Tí eshuwotso! it jangosh Ik'o jam aawo udiruwone, udonwere noosh geyike, no udiruwere it aman amano iki bogt bí eniruwnat it it atsatse shuneyo dabfere b́ amiruwotsne. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Mansh eshe gishewonat gond bek'on dab itats b́ bodalor it aawk'o it k'amtsok'onat it imnetiyatse kúp' it wottsok'o keewon noo k'osh Ik' moowwots dagotse wotdekat itn it'irwone.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Jam keewan b́ kitsir Ik' angsho arik b́ wotok'onat itwere bísha etaat gond bek'o it dek'ts mengst mansh bodk it wotitwok'oniye. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Kááw keew k'alitwo Ik'o b́wottsotse it ats gondbek'o dowirwotsats gond bek'o dowon bok'awntso boosh dashetwe. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>And gond bek'o daatsirwotswere noonton kashdek'o itsh imetwe. Han b́wotitwere doonzo Iyesus b́melaki kúp'wotsnton darotse b́ oot'oore, <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>bí darootse be'et aat'iru tawone, manoor Ik'o danawwotsnat nondoozo Iyesusko dooshishyosh alerawwotsi sezitwe. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa. 2:10</ref> </char></note> Bo doonz shinatsnat bí een mangatse k'aleyaarr dúre dúri t'afon bo sezeti. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Bo bo sezitwere manots aawots bík s'ayinwotsoke mangr bín amanir jamwotsoknowere adewosh b́wooree. Itwere noo gawuts gawo dek'at it amantsotse bonton taawetute.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Han gawon itsh no eed'irawo nó Ik'o no k'onir b́ s'egots s'eegosh bodtswotsi iti woshr sheeng finosh it detsts shunonat imneti fin jamo bí angon finde itsh b́s'eentsitwok'owe. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Mank'o no doonz Iyesus shútso ititsere mangr itwere noko Izar Izewernat no doonz Iyesus s'aatok'on bín it mangitwok'o Ik'o k'onirwone.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Doonzo wooniyere shino morr gond shayro b́be'etwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1 Tes. 4:15-17</ref> </char>
    </note> Ti eshuwotso! no doonz Iyesus Krstos woonat noowere bínton wotosh nokakweyi jangosh itn nok'onirwo haniye, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Wee shayiron wee aap'on keewetsok'on wee noyitse woshoon guut'etsok'on woshde'er «Doonzo aawo waare» eton kááron it nibo shek'eek'aye, kic'ono kic'k'ayere. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Asho ik keewonor itn b́ant'elcerawok'k'owa, shin shino haalo b́warawon, Ik'o bín b́t'afit weeri gond asho b́be'erawo, aawman waratse. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan. 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Hzk'. 28:2</ref> </char></note> Weerr gond ashaan Izar Izewerotsiye ett ik'iyeyiru jam keewotsiyere damb b́tooko een b́wooshfoni, «Ik'o taane» erfetsrnwere dab Ik'i mootse bewosh ááw shuk'on b́ned'iti.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Itnton tteshor keewanotsi itsh keewat tteshtsok'o gawraatsteya? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Bísh beezets sa'aton b́be'efetsosh and b́be'erawok'o bín baziyiruwo eeg b́wottsok'owo danfte. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Aashts weer gondi angman fino dek'tuure, b́wotefere andoor baziyirwo fa'e, han b́wotwere baziyiru ekeew b́t'affetsoniye. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa. 11:4</ref> </char></note> Maniyere ilowere nemalon beyiruman be'etwe, doonzo Iyesus b́ nonotsi kash jongon bín úditwe, be'eyi eenon aanar b́ woor b́beyoko t'afibazetwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat. 24:24</ref> </char></note> Mor gond asho b́weet shed'ani angon kootets aditswotsnat milikituwotsn ayi adits keewwotsnowere k'alone, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Mank'owere t'afit ashuwotsi bín bo dashit eeg naari gond keewwotsi k'alone. Ashaanots bot'afitwere kashosh boon betsitwo ariko shunt dek'o bo k'aztsotsne. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Man jangosh kooton boamanituwok'o Ik'o boon ant'elcit ango boats woshitwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Hanwere b́ wotit aro amaneratsone et morrats geneúwiru jamwotsats angshetwok'owe.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kashosh gaalets ashuwots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Doonzon shuneets eshuwotso! noomó it jangosh Ik'o jam aawo udo noosh geyife, no uditwere it shayiri S'ayinon it s'ayinontsonat arono it amanon it kashitwok'o Ik'o shini itn galb́dek'tsoshe. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Ik'o no itsh no nabts doo shishiyann itn s'eegts doonzo Iyesus Krstos mango it kayitwok'owe. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Mansh t eshuwotso, kúp'arr need'ore, it aap'ona wotowa guut'ets woshon nooke itsh beshts dano kúp'ide'er deshere. <verse eid="2TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>B́ tookon no doonz Iyesus Krstosnat, noon shuntso, b́ s'aaton dúre dúri kúp'iyo, sheeng jangóno noosh imtso Ik'o no nihiye. <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>Bí it maac'o kúp'shwe, sheeng finonat sheeng noon keew jamon itn kup'shwe.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' k'ono jamosh b́ geyitwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>S'uwatsno ti eshwotso! itokere wottsok'o doonzo aap'tso káári jamok borr b́ mangitwok'o noosh Ik'o k'onuwere. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Mank'owere jam asho amankaaliye, mansh weri gondetswotsnat gond ashuwotsatse no faritwok'o noosh Ik'o k'onuwere.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Doonzonmó amaneke, bí itn kup'shitwe, gondatsnowere itn kotetwe. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Itn no azazitwo and wotowa shino maants it k'alitwok'o it jangosh doonzo ats amanatniye.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Doonzonú it nibo Ik' shúnonat Krstos k'amo maants jishwe.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fin bitsatse boatso korbodek'etwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Tí eshúwotso! fin bitstsk wottsonat nookere itsh beeshiyets danok'on beeraw krstiyani jamatse it galetwok'o doonzo Iyesus Krstos shútson itn azazerone. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Noon aro itsh b́k'anitwok'o it it tookonor danfte, noo itnton noteshor fino biitstswotsi teyatsone, <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Kon mishonor datsmec'ron mááratsone, dabnwor ititse konatsor kuro nowoterawok'owa etaat t'uwe aawo no maawfetsosha nofinefoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Mank'o nok'alwere it noon araar no jafrats it sha'iitwok'owa etaatni bako itkooke tep'o dek'o noosh b́ faletwok'o daratniyaliye. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Itnton noteshor «Fin finosh geerawo maak'aye» etts niwo itsh imrone b́ teshi.<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Han noo etwere ititsere ik ik fin biitstswots bo fa'ok'o t shishtsotsne, ashaanots boon geraw keewots kinda bako botookon eegor fineratsne. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Hank'o ashuwots s'ker beyar bo finitwok'o bín bo beetwo bodaatsitwok'o doonzo Iyesus Krstos shútson hanotsk'o ashuwotsi azazerone, izitwone.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Itmó ti eshúwotso! shaatsrone err sheeng fin finosh nefk'ayere. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Woshanitse itsh nobeshits izo de'aw asho b́ beyal hank'o ashaan t'iwintswere, b́ jitsitwok'owere bínton gonkek'ayere. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>B́ wotefere eshúwok'o izwere bako t'alatok'o taawk'ayere.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Jeeni doonzo b́ tookon jam aawo jam keewon jeeno itsh ime, doonzo it únetsnton wotowe.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Jamán t kishon itsh guut'tso taane P'awlosiye, t wosh jamotse daatset wosho tik b́wti milikito haniye. T guut'etwere hank'owe.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>No doonz Iyesus Krstos s'aato it únetsnton wotowe.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
